{"list":"Burly Men At Sea","platforms":["PS4","PSVITA"],"trophies":[{"id":0,"n":"Ye've Done It","d":"“This day, you reach the end of a story,” she continues, “and the last of its paths.”","t":"platinum","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/27F3FF6FC7DCD665C93F081193A110B7FEB8D611.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":19.6},{"id":1,"n":"Great Barnacled One","d":"It’s dark inside the whale, but the men appear to be intact.","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/9A0436F66792FAFF5D99A41EDAB848613E916756.PNG","g":"default","e":true,"at":"2020-04-16T20:40:12+00:00","r":55.3,"h":true},{"id":2,"n":"Wooden Trousers","d":"“Aye, they’ll float,” nods Steady Beard.","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/B3A112F2DB41242B675CD76E165EF7064D2C943D.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":37.2,"h":true},{"id":3,"n":"Fountain of the Faithless","d":"“Give me water, and I’ll teach it to carry me!”","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/B0FB208F60A7F2DDF0224110D4E5E9A416025F64.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":33.1,"h":true},{"id":4,"n":"The Path of Waiting","d":"“Time flows quickly in contemplation of the Great One’s splendor.”","t":"bronze","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/009150E43BFB3BEF8141A19078963FCCD63EF046.PNG","g":"default","e":true,"at":"2020-04-16T20:42:51+00:00","r":35.5,"h":true},{"id":5,"n":"The Long Way","d":"“Really very sorry for scuttling your promotion and all that,” offers Steady Beard.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/1882984C8421400DFBFC2C6C40280BBE75A6F7C9.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":33.6,"h":true},{"id":6,"n":"Complimentary Trip to the Afterlife","d":"“Shouldn’t you be a bit more chipper, having won and all?” prods Steady Beard.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/428F94E60C03DC1BB4D5EF94EB876858508EF2B6.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":24.7,"h":true},{"id":7,"n":"A Bargain to Make","d":"“Right, then. Let’s be off!” commands Brave Beard, striking a leaderly pose.","t":"gold","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/70AF6E4D2B7C4C39E664149BEB9F9FBFD5EFB51B.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":22.0,"h":true},{"id":8,"n":"Vengeance Satisfied","d":"The creature drags the struggling men deeper beneath the waves, finally tossing them aside in disgust.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/0540B38E8E75DF4FB69B3B4D092369CEA67C523E.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":29.2,"h":true},{"id":9,"n":"QUITE GOOD AT FLOWERS","d":"“Quick, while we’ve a chance!” whispers Hasty Beard, leading the way to the boat.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/8DE400F8106390A3521D1F1448C2BB0965276553.PNG","g":"default","e":true,"at":"2020-04-16T20:46:53+00:00","r":32.1,"h":true},{"id":10,"n":"QUITE GOOD AT THROWING","d":"“Great idea!” cuts in Steady Beard. “How about a demonstration?”","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/7568E44F2F5554D93809E52035D7DD939F7B7AA4.PNG","g":"default","e":false,"at":null,"r":23.0,"h":true},{"id":11,"n":"Getting Your Beards Wet","d":"The orbs lead on, out through the cavern’s deep tunnels and beyond the island.","t":"silver","i":"https://image.api.playstation.com/trophy/np/NPWR13664_00_0043A76295BEB3DCC497B231953D0161A5AB94D422/B45A